'''Ghost''' is a type of {{moncat|undead}} [[undead]] [[monster]] .

Ghosts have subtypes called [[wraith spirit]], ghost pirate, ghost soldiers, and [[Dockhand Wraith]] (ghost that use bandit 3D model but only spawns in port areas).
